    "primary_cause": "At the decisive Azil follower wave, native Righteous Defense was unavailable or rejected, Hammer of the Righteous acquired only six of thirteen engaged hostiles, and a valid area-action movement branch returned before the existing five-attacker Hand of Protection emergency and lower rescue chain could run. Twelve initial healer attackers grew to fourteen, and the longest hostile remained on the healer for 6646 ms.",
